  "prefLabel": "Rev 501.12 Reclaimed area",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Rev 501.12 \"Reclaimed area\" means any excavation area that has been brought into compliance with applicable local ordinances and reclamation standards as set forth pursuant to RSA 155-E.\n\nSource. #9926, eff 5-18-11 (from Rev 501.09); ss by #12834, eff 7-25-19",
